<% content_for :title, "Privacy Policy" %>

<article class="legal-page">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>Last updated: 10 July 2026</p>

  <p>
    This policy explains what personal data Mandala collects, why, and who
    processes it, in line with Article 13 of the General Data Protection
    Regulation (GDPR).
  </p>

  <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
  <p>
    The data controller for this service is:
  </p>
  <p>
    Jeffrey Long<br>
    2842 E. 50th Ct.<br>
    Des Moines, IA 50317<br>
    United States<br>
    Email: jeff@jlintelligence.net
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect and why</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Your email address and password.</strong> Used to create and
      secure your account and to sign you in. The password is never stored in
      readable form &mdash; only a one-way hash is kept.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>The content you create.</strong> The mandalas, grids, tiles and
      summaries you write are stored so the app can show them back to you.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Session and security data.</strong> When you sign in we record
      the session's IP address and browser user-agent, and the server keeps
      standard request logs. This lets us keep the account secure and prevent
      abuse.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Email verification and password-reset tokens.</strong> Short-lived
      tokens sent to your email address to confirm it or reset your password.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Legal basis</h2>
  <p>
    We process your account data and content to provide the service you signed
    up for (performance of a contract, GDPR Art. 6(1)(b)). We process session
    and log data to keep the service secure (legitimate interests, GDPR
    Art. 6(1)(f)).
  </p>

  <h2>Who processes your data</h2>
  <p>
    The service runs entirely on EU-resident infrastructure. We use the
    following processors:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Hosting:</strong> Hetzner Online GmbH, Germany &mdash; runs the
      application server and database.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Transactional email:</strong> Scaleway SAS, France &mdash;
      delivers verification and password-reset emails.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Backup and file storage:</strong> Scaleway Object Storage
      (Paris region), France &mdash; holds database backups and any files you
      upload.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    Mandala sets a single, strictly necessary session cookie so you stay signed
    in. It is not used for analytics or advertising, and no consent banner is
    required for it. We use no third-party analytics or tracking cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    Account data and content are kept for as long as your account exists.
    Database backups are retained for 30 days. Server logs are kept only as
    long as needed for security and troubleshooting.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under the GDPR you have the right to access, correct, export, restrict, or
    delete your personal data, and to object to its processing. To exercise any
    of these, email jeff@jlintelligence.net and we will action the request. You also
    have the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory
    authority.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted on this page with
    a new date above.
  </p>
</article>
